sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant UAS as UserAccounts-Service
    participant PS as Payments-Service
    participant NS as Notifications-Service
    participant UASDB as UserAccounts-DB
    participant PSDB as Payments-DB
    participant NSDB as Notifications-DB

    Note over C,UAS: ========== User Registration (Authentication) ==========
    C->>UAS: POST /auth/register (userId, pwd, roles)
    UAS->>UASDB: Store user credentials & roles
    UASDB-->>UAS: Registration Success
    UAS-->>C: Registration Success

    Note over C,UAS: ========== Token Generation ==========
    C->>UAS: POST /auth/login (userId, pwd)
    UAS->>UASDB: Validate credentials
    UASDB-->>UAS: Credentials Valid
    UAS-->>C: JWT Token

    Note over C,UAS: ========== Authenticated User Registration ==========
    C->>UAS: POST ap1/v1/users/register (JWT Token, Personal + Contact + KYC Details)
    UAS->>UAS: Validate JWT Token
    UAS->>UASDB: Create Customer, CIF & Account (Status:PENDING)
    UASDB-->>UAS: Creation Success
    UAS->>NS: POST ap1/notifications/send (JWT Token, Registration Notification)
    NS->>NS: Validate JWT Token
    NS->>NSDB: Store Notification
    NSDB-->>NS: Stored
    NS-->>UAS: Notification Sent
    UAS-->>C: Registration Success (Customer Number)

    Note over C,UAS: ========== Authenticated Status Inquiry ==========
    C->>UAS: GET ap1/v1/users/pending/{customerNumber} (JWT Token)
    UAS->>UAS: Validate JWT Token
    UAS->>UASDB: Fetch Registration Status
    UASDB-->>UAS: Status Details
    UAS-->>C: Status Response

    Note over C,UAS: ========== Authenticated Admin Status Update ==========
    C->>UAS: PUT ap1/v1/users/update (JWT Token)
    UAS->>UAS: Validate JWT Token
    UAS->>UASDB: Update Customer Status to ACTIVE
    UASDB-->>UAS: Update Success
    UAS->>NS: POST ap1/notifications/send (JWT Token, Status Update Notification)
    NS->>NS: Validate JWT Token
    NS->>NSDB: Store Notification
    NSDB-->>NS: Stored
    NS-->>UAS: Notification Sent
    UAS-->>C: Status Update Success Response

    Note over C,PS: ========== Authenticated Payment Flow ==========
    C->>PS: POST ap1/v1/payments/createPayment (JWT Token, FromAccount + ToAccount + Amount)
    PS->>PS: Validate JWT Token
    PS->>PSDB: Process & Store Payment
    PSDB-->>PS: Payment Stored
    PS->>NS: POST ap1/notifications/send (JWT Token, Payment Notification)
    NS->>NS: Validate JWT Token
    NS->>NSDB: Store Notification
    NSDB-->>NS: Stored
    NS-->>PS: Notification Sent
    PS-->>C: Payment Success Response